<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<script>(function(){try{fetch('_rzrq_meta.json?v='+Date.now()).then(function(r){return r.json();}).then(function(m){if(!m||!m.builtAt)return;var cur=new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('v');if(cur!==m.builtAt){location.replace('rzrq_updown_detail.html?v='+encodeURIComponent(m.builtAt));}}).catch(function(){});}catch(e){}})();</script>
<title>融资余额（日/周/月） &amp; 上涨家数</title>
<style>*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{background:#eef1f6;font-family:-apple-system,"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;color:#1f2937;padding:22px}
.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 6px 28px rgba(31,41,55,.08);overflow:hidden}
.hd{padding:20px 28px 4px}
.hd h1{font-size:21px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.5px}
.hd .sub{color:#94a3b8;font-size:13px;margin-top:5px;line-height:1.8}
.hd .sub b{color:#475569}
.srcbar{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:10px 28px 0;font-size:12px}
.srcbar .s{background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #eef1f6;border-radius:8px;padding:6px 10px;color:#64748b}
.srcbar .s b{color:#1f2937}
.rngbar{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding:14px 28px 4px}
.rngbar.gran{padding:6px 28px 2px}
.unigran{border-top:1px solid #eef1f6;margin-top:8px}
.gran-hint{font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8;margin-left:12px}
.rngrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.rngrow2{flex-wrap:nowrap}
.asof{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:#2f6bff;background:#eaf1ff;border-radius:20px;padding:5px 14px;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:10px}
.asof b{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.rngbar .lbl{font-size:13px;color:#64748b;margin-right:2px;white-space:nowrap}
.seg{display:inline-flex;border:1px solid #dbe3ef;border-radius:9px;overflow:hidden}
.seg button{border:0;background:#fff;padding:7px 18px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;cursor:pointer}
.seg button.on{background:#2f6bff;color:#fff}
.seg button+button{border-left:1px solid #dbe3ef}
.rng-btn{border:1px solid #dbe3ef;background:#fff;color:#475569;font-size:13px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:9px;cursor:pointer;transition:.15s;white-space:nowrap}
.rng-btn:hover{border-color:#2f6bff;color:#2f6bff}
.rng-btn.active{background:#2f6bff;border-color:#2f6bff;color:#fff;font-weight:600}
/* 指定时间段（两图同步） */
.cr-btn{border:1px solid #dbe3ef;background:#fff;color:#475569;font-size:13px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:9px;cursor:pointer;transition:.15s;white-space:nowrap}
.cr-btn:hover{border-color:#7c3aed;color:#7c3aed}
.cr-btn.active{background:#7c3aed;border-color:#7c3aed;color:#fff;font-weight:600}
.cr-dd{position:relative;display:none}
.cr-dd.open{display:block}
.cr-panel{position:absolute;top:calc(100% + 4px);left:0;z-index:85;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dbe2ec;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(15,23,42,.14);padding:12px 14px;width:260px}
.cr-hd{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#334155;margin-bottom:8px}
.cr-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;font-size:12.5px;color:#64748b;margin:6px 0}
.cr-row input[type=date]{font-size:12.5px;padding:5px 7px;border:1px solid #dbe2ec;border-radius:7px;color:#334155;width:158px;font-family:inherit}
.cr-msg{font-size:11.5px;color:#94a3b8;line-height:1.5;margin:6px 0;min-height:15px}
.cr-msg.err{color:#e24b4a}
.cr-act{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px}
.cr-act button{flex:1;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;padding:6px 0;border:1px solid #dbe2ec;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:7px;cursor:pointer}
.cr-act button:first-child{background:#7c3aed;border-color:#7c3aed;color:#fff}
.cr-act button:first-child:hover{background:#6d28d9}
thead th:nth-child(1),tbody td:nth-child(1){white-space:nowrap}
/* 融资余额表日期单元格：蓝色+手型，引导点击下钻 */
#tbody-m td.drill-date{color:#2f6bff;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
#tbody-m td.drill-date:hover{text-decoration:underline}
.legend{padding:4px 28px 0;font-size:12px;color:#64748b;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}
.legend .lrow{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.legend .lg{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px}
.legend .lg[data-lg]{cursor:pointer;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 3px;margin:-1px -3px;transition:opacity .15s}
.legend .lg[data-lg]:hover{background:rgba(47,107,255,.08)}
.legend .lg.blue{color:#2f6bff}.legend .lg.red{color:#c0392b}
.legend .mut{color:#9aa3b2}
.legend .mrow{white-space:normal;overflow:visible}
.chartbox{position:relative;padding:6px 14px 8px}
/* ---- 横屏看图（⛶ 按钮在图下方；桌面宽屏隐藏） ---- */
.lsrow-out{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;padding:0 28px 6px}
.ls-btn{font-size:12px;color:#475569;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dbe2ec;border-radius:8px;padding:5px 12px;cursor:pointer;line-height:1.5}
.ls-btn:active{background:#eef2f7}
@media (min-width:768px){.lsrow-out{display:none}}
@media (max-width:767px){.lsrow-out{padding:0 14px 4px}}
/* ---- 对标指数多选面板 ---- */
.idxdd{position:relative;display:inline-block}
.idx-btn{font-size:12.5px;color:#334155;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dbe2ec;border-radius:8px;padding:6px 12px;cursor:pointer;max-width:62vw;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.idx-panel{display:none;position:absolute;top:calc(100% + 4px);left:0;z-index:80;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dbe2ec;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(15,23,42,.14);padding:8px 10px;width:250px}
.idx-panel.open{display:block}
.idx-pact{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-bottom:6px}
.idx-pact button{flex:1;font-size:12px;padding:5px 0;border:1px solid #dbe2ec;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:7px;cursor:pointer}
.idx-plist{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2px 10px;max-height:220px;overflow:auto}
.idx-norm{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:6px;font-size:12px;color:#64748b;margin-top:8px;padding-top:7px;border-top:1px solid #eef1f6;cursor:pointer;line-height:1.4}
.idx-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12.5px;color:#334155;padding:5px 2px;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}
#eEtfPanel{width:352px}
#eEtfList .idx-item{font-size:11.5px;padding:4px 2px;gap:5px}
#eEtfList .idx-item span{overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;max-width:150px}
#lsOv{position:fixed;inset:0;background:#f6f8fb;z-index:99998;display:none}
#lsOv.on{display:block}
#lsWrap{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;transform-origin:top left;transform:rotate(90deg) translateY(-100%)}
.ls-card{box-sizing:border-box;transform-origin:top left}
#lsClose{position:fixed;top:10px;right:10px;z-index:99999;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#e24b4a;background:#fff;border:1px solid #f3c1c1;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 14px;cursor:pointer}
body.lslock{overflow:hidden}
.etfchart-sec{margin:18px 0 0}
.etfchart-hd{padding:14px 28px 4px}
.etfchart-title{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f2a44}
.etfchart-sub{font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.6}
.idx-sel-row{margin-top:2px}
.idx-sel-row select{font-size:12.5px;padding:4px 8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:6px;color:#0f766e;background:#fff;max-width:150px}
.idx-sel-row .idx-tip{font-size:11.5px;color:#94a3b8}
.etfchart-sec .descfold{margin:12px 28px 0}
.etf-desc .sub>div{padding:8px 0 8px 14px;border-left:3px solid #e2e8f0;margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.85}
.etf-desc .sub>div:last-child{margin-bottom:0;border-left-color:#f1f5f9}
#etip{position:absolute;pointer-events:none;opacity:0;transition:opacity .08s;background:rgba(255,255,255,.97);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(31,41,55,.14);padding:10px 14px;font-size:12px;min-width:185px;z-index:5}
#etip .t-d{font-weight:700;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:6px;color:#1f2937}
#etip .t-r{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;line-height:1.7;color:#64748b}
#etip .t-r b{color:#1f2937;font-weight:700}
.tblsec{margin:16px 28px 0;border:1px solid #e8edf5;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}
.descfold{margin:16px 28px 0;border:1px solid #e8edf5;border-radius:12px;background:#fbfcfe}
.descfold summary{padding:11px 16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;cursor:pointer;user-select:none;list-style:none}
.descfold summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.descfold summary::before{content:"▸ ";color:#94a3b8}
.descfold[open] summary::before{content:"▾ "}
.descfold summary:hover{color:#2f6bff}
.descfold .sub{font-size:12.5px;color:#64748b;line-height:1.7;padding:0 16px 10px}
.descfold .srcbar{margin:0 16px 12px}
.descfold .note{padding:0 16px 14px}
.tbltabs{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:14px 16px 0;flex-wrap:wrap}
.tbtn{border:1px solid #dbe3ef;background:#fff;color:#475569;font-size:13px;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:10px 10px 0 0;cursor:pointer;transition:.15s}
.tbtn:hover{border-color:#2f6bff;color:#2f6bff}
.tbtn.active{background:#1f2937;border-color:#1f2937;color:#fff;font-weight:600}
.tpanel{border-top:1px solid #eef1f6;padding-top:4px}
.tblbox{padding:6px 16px 8px}
.tbl{max-height:500px;overflow:auto;overflow-x:auto;border:1px solid #eef1f6;border-radius:10px}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px}
thead th{position:sticky;top:0;background:#f8fafc;color:#64748b;font-weight:600;text-align:center;padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8edf5;cursor:pointer;user-select:none;white-space:nowrap}
thead th:hover{color:#2f6bff;background:#eef3fb}
thead th::after{content:" ⇅";font-size:.72em;color:#aab4c5;margin-left:3px}
thead th.sort-asc::after{content:" ↑";font-size:.72em;color:#2f6bff;margin-left:3px}
thead th.sort-desc::after{content:" ↓";font-size:.72em;color:#2f6bff;margin-left:3px}
tbody td{padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f5f9;text-align:right}
tbody td:nth-child(1){text-align:left;color:#475569}
tbody tr:hover{background:#f6f9ff}
.num{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}
.pos{color:#e5484d}.neg{color:#2f9e44}.upc{color:#c0392b}.dnc{color:#27632a}
.note{padding:12px 28px 22px;color:#9aa3b2;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8}
#tip{position:absolute;pointer-events:none;opacity:0;transition:opacity .08s;background:rgba(255,255,255,.97);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(31,41,55,.14);padding:10px 14px;font-size:12px;min-width:185px;z-index:5}
#tip .t-d{font-weight:700;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:6px;color:#1f2937}
#tip .t-r{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;line-height:1.7;color:#64748b}
#tip .t-r b{color:#1f2937;font-weight:700}
@media(max-width:600px){
  body{padding:10px}
  .hd{padding:14px 14px 2px}
  .hd h1{font-size:17px}
  .hd .sub{font-size:11.5px}
  .asof{font-size:11.5px;padding:4px 10px;margin-bottom:6px}
  .srcbar{padding:8px 14px 0;gap:6px}
  .srcbar .s{font-size:11px;padding:5px 8px}
  .rngbar{padding:10px 14px 2px;gap:6px}
  .rngrow{gap:6px}
  .rngbar .lbl{font-size:11px}
  .seg button{padding:6px 14px;font-size:12px}
  .rngrow2 .rng-btn{flex:1;padding:6px 2px;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:8px;text-align:center}
  .legend{padding:4px 14px 0;font-size:10px;gap:3px}
  .legend .lrow{gap:8px;font-size:10px}
  .legend .mrow{font-size:10px}
  .rngbar.gran{padding:4px 14px 0}
  .tbltabs{padding:10px 14px 0;gap:6px}
  .tbtn{font-size:12px;padding:7px 12px}
  .tblbox{padding:6px 14px 8px}
  .tblsec{margin:14px 14px 0}
  .tbl{max-height:64vh;overflow-x:auto}
  table{font-size:13.5px}
  thead th{padding:9px 10px}
  tbody td{padding:8px 10px}
  .note{padding:10px 14px 16px;font-size:11px}
}</style></head>
<body><div class="wrap"><div class="hd">
<div class="asof">行情最新：<b>2026-11-24</b>（涨跌家数） · 融资余额最新披露：<b>2026-11-23</b>（两融 T+1 披露）</div>
<h1>A股 · 融资余额（日/周/月） &amp; 上涨家数</h1>
<div class="sub">单图双轴：左轴（蓝刻度）=融资余额蓝线（随粒度切快照），右轴（红刻度）=上涨家数红线（恒为每日）。</div>
</div>
<div class="rngbar" id="mRng">
<div class="rngrow rngrow2"><span class="lbl rng-lbl">时间段：</span>
<button class="rng-btn" data-range="m1">1个月</button>
<button class="rng-btn active" data-range="m3">3个月</button>
<button class="rng-btn" data-range="m6">半年</button>
<button class="rng-btn" data-range="ytd">今年以来</button>
<button class="rng-btn" data-range="all">全部</button>
<button class="cr-btn" id="crBtnM" type="button">指定时间段</button>
</div>
<div class="cr-dd" id="crDD"><div class="cr-panel">
<div class="cr-hd">指定时间段（两图同步）</div>
<label class="cr-row">开始<input type="date" id="crStart"></label>
<label class="cr-row">结束<input type="date" id="crEnd"></label>
<div class="cr-msg" id="crMsg"></div>
<div class="cr-act"><button type="button" id="crApply">应用</button><button type="button" id="crReset">重置</button></div>
</div></div>
</div>
<div class="chartbox" id="box">
<svg id="svg" viewBox="0 0 1000 436" width="100%" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<g id="plot"></g>
<line id="vline" x1="0" y1="46" x2="0" y2="402" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="4 3" style="opacity:0"/>
<circle id="focusL" cx="0" cy="0" r="5" fill="#2f6bff" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" style="opacity:0"/>
<circle id="focusR" cx="0" cy="0" r="4.5" fill="#c0392b" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.8" style="opacity:0"/>
<rect id="overlay" x="70" y="46" width="860" height="356" fill="transparent" style="cursor:crosshair"/>
</svg>
<div id="tip"></div></div>
<div class="legend" id="lg"></div>
<div class="lsrow-out"><button class="ls-btn" data-ls="main" type="button">⛶ 横屏</button></div>
<div class="etfchart-sec">
<div class="etfchart-hd">
<div class="etfchart-title">宽基 ETF 资金流（全市场净申购）</div>
<div class="etfchart-sub">12 宽基指数 · 30 只头部 ETF · 全历史逐日净申购（口径与数据说明见图表下方）</div>
</div>
<div class="rngbar" id="eRng"><div class="rngrow rngrow2"><span class="lbl rng-lbl">时间段：</span>
<button class="rng-btn" data-range="m1">1个月</button>
<button class="rng-btn active" data-range="m3">3个月</button>
<button class="rng-btn" data-range="m6">半年</button>
<button class="rng-btn" data-range="ytd">今年以来</button>
<button class="rng-btn" data-range="all">全部</button>
<button class="cr-btn" id="crBtnE" type="button">指定时间段</button>
</div>
<div class="rngrow idx-sel-row"><span class="lbl rng-lbl">对标指数：</span>
<div class="idxdd" id="idxDd"><button class="idx-btn" id="eIdxBtn" type="button">全部汇总(12指数)</button>
<div class="idx-panel" id="eIdxPanel"><div class="idx-pact"><button type="button" data-act="all">全选</button><button type="button" data-act="none">清空</button></div><div class="idx-plist" id="eIdxList"></div><label class="idx-norm"><input type="checkbox" id="eNormChk" checked><span>归一化（基期=100，便于比较涨跌；取消则显示真实点位）</span></label></div>
<input type="hidden" id="eIdxSel" value="__ALL__">
</div>
<span class="lbl rng-lbl" style="margin-left:10px">对标ETF：</span>
<div class="idxdd" id="etfDd"><button class="idx-btn" id="eEtfBtn" type="button">无</button>
<div class="idx-panel" id="eEtfPanel"><div class="idx-pact"><button type="button" data-act="all">全选</button><button type="button" data-act="none">清空</button></div><div class="idx-plist" id="eEtfList"></div><label class="idx-norm"><span>净值线固定归一化（基期=100）；含ETF时全部对标线统一归一化以便同轴比较</span></label></div>
<input type="hidden" id="eEtfSel" value="__ALL__">
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="chartbox" id="ebox">
<svg id="esvg" viewBox="0 0 1000 436" width="100%" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<g id="eplot"></g>
<line id="evline" x1="0" y1="46" x2="0" y2="402" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="4 3" style="opacity:0"/>
<rect id="eoverlay" x="70" y="46" width="860" height="356" fill="transparent" style="cursor:crosshair"/>
</svg>
<div id="etip"></div></div>
<div class="legend" id="elg"></div>
<div class="lsrow-out"><button class="ls-btn" data-ls="etf" type="button">⛶ 横屏</button></div>
<details class="descfold etf-desc"><summary>口径与数据说明（默认折叠，点击展开）</summary>
<div class="sub">
<div><b>① 指标口径</b>：蓝线＝全市场<b>累计净申购</b>（2012 前置锚点＋成分 ETF 全历史逐日净申购累加，净流量累计非规模存量），柱＝当日净申购<b>12 指数分段堆叠</b>（正红负绿，色深=指数，悬停看构成明细；周/月粒度下为周期累加）。<b>蓝线累计恒为全市场不随选择变化</b>；选中对标指数后，<b>当日柱只堆叠所选指数分段</b>（未选指数置 0）。<b>对标指数多选</b>：叠加所选指数<b>点位线</b>（专属色）。<b>对标ETF多选</b>：叠加所选 ETF 的<b>前复权净值线</b>（虚线）；净值(元)与点位(点)量纲不同，故对标线统一<b>归一化(基期=100)</b>才可同轴比较——含 ETF 时指数线也强制归一化。默认两类对标均不选＝无对标线。12 指数为互斥分组（30 只 ETF 各归一组）。紫色阶梯线＝汇金持股票 ETF 市值（第三方季报估算，<b>全市场存量口径</b>，仅在量级匹配时显示）；累计早期为负属真实数据。</div>
<div><b>② 为何与「国家队持仓」不等价</b>：本图为<b>一级市场申赎口径</b>，<b>不含二级市场买卖</b> —— 国家队经二级市场受让份额不产生净申购数据，故蓝线平坦不能推出「国家队没持有」。全市场净申购，非汇金独占。</div>
<div><b>③ 关键事件</b>：2024-02-06 汇金公告增持四大行及多只 ETF（2024 年一级净申购 +8,349 亿）；2026-01-14 沪指冲高 4190 点、汇金启动大规模减持（2026 上半年 −16,946 亿）；2026-06-08 汇金重启增持，宽基 ETF 转净流入（7–11 月 +7,121 亿）。汇金减持的是波段仓位，六大行等永久底仓约 3.37 万亿未动。</div>
<div><b>④ 数据来源</b>：iFinD 基金日频净流入额（30 只宽基 ETF，逐只按 ≤100 日历天窗口拉取，902 个窗口），已用 iFinD「区间净流入额」全历史锚点逐只对账（30/30 通过）；各指数点位为腾讯行情日线（中证2000 走 iFinD 指数日频）；30 只 ETF 前复权净值为腾讯行情 qfq 日线，按本图日期轴对齐（新上市 ETF 上市前无值）。累计值为<b>净流量累计</b>而非 ETF 规模存量，早期为负属真实数据。</div>
</div></details>
</div>
